  "body": "Thank you for your excellent open-source work. I’ve been trying to compare some experimental results with those presented in your paper, but I’m finding it quite difficult to reproduce the visualizations, especially when converting single-dimensional data into the figures shown.\n\nWould it be possible for you to share the plotting scripts or any relevant code used to generate the figures in your paper? This would greatly help me with my result analysis and ensure a more accurate comparison.\n\nThank you in advance for your time and help!\n\n<img width=\"1224\" height=\"656\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f476b57-f75e-4bd4-8dc3-a46f59105b9e\" />",
